[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Mismatches found
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **None.** Every input class enumerated below produced identical stdout, stderr
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and exit status. In addition to the checked-in tests, an out-of-tree
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m differential fuzzer was run over ~3,000 randomized inputs plus ~120 curated
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ones, against the C program built both at `-O0` (the default CMake flags, which
